Create Crafts & Additions - modified, unofficial SkyTekx build for Forge 1.20.1
=============================================================================

This is a MODIFIED, UNOFFICIAL version of Create Crafts & Additions. It is not made, supported or
endorsed by MRH0. Please report problems with this build to SkyTekx
(https://github.com/skytekx/skytekx3-1201-server/issues), not to the upstream project.

Original work
-------------
  Create Crafts & Additions by MRH0 and contributors
  Source:   https://github.com/mrh0/createaddition
  Base:     branch 1.20.1 @ 42b6f2d06f0412a7cee787d767449d5b1b3b81b8 (2026-11-02; mod_version 1.3.3
            plus the merged, unreleased upstream changes after the 1.3.3 release; Forge 47)
  Backport: content taken from branch 1.21.1 @ 658a390b8ff4daa17013e9447b29949330c8a42a
            (2026-11-02; mod_version 1.7.3, NeoForge 1.21.1)

Modifications
-------------
  Modified by SkyTekx (Florian Kleber), 2026, for the SkyTekx 3 modpack. The result still runs on
  Minecraft 1.20.1 with Forge 47, keeps the mod id createaddition and is versioned
  1.7.3-1.20.1-skytekx.1.

  Summary of the changes:
  - Build: reproducible jar (no file timestamps, fixed entry order, no build timestamp in the
    manifest); this NOTICE and the upstream LICENSE ship inside the jar; mods.toml marks the build
    as a modified, unofficial one and sends bug reports to SkyTekx.
  - Content backported from the 1.21.1 line is listed here as it is added.

  The complete change history is the git history of the ports/createaddition directory of
  https://github.com/skytekx/skytekx3-1201-server
  That directory is the source code of this jar: the exact source of a given jar is that directory
  at the commit that added the jar to local-mods/. ports/createaddition/UPSTREAM.md lists every
  change to the upstream build.

